### Create a Project
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ALICE_TOKEN}}

{
    "name": "Website Redesign",
    "description": "Revamp the company landing page and customer portal",
    "organizationId": 6
}
###

### Get Project by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/1?orgId=6
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ALICE_TOKEN}}

{
}
###

### List All Projects for an Organization
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/organization/6
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ALICE_TOKEN}}

{
}
###

### Update Project Details
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/1?orgId=6
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ALICE_TOKEN}}

{
    "name": "Website Redesign Phase 2",
    "description": "Updated project description with extended scope"
}
###

### Add Member to Project (Many-to-Many)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/6/members
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ALICE_TOKEN}}

{
    "userId": 6,
    "role": "MEMBER"
}
###

### Add Bob (Newly added User) to the Project
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/1/members/6?orgId=6
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ALICE_TOKEN}}

{
}
###

### Remove Member from Project
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/1/members/6?orgId=6
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ALICE_TOKEN}}

{
}
###

### Delete Project: This cascades and automatically removes associated entries in `tasks` and `project_user` join tables.*
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/2?orgId=6
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ALICE_TOKEN}}

{
}
